{"id":"ves_ma","lemma":"весьма","pos":"adv","rank":635,"glosses":["quite, rather"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/21/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BC%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BC%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это было весьма очевидно.","en":"It was very obvious.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"apparently, obviously"}]},{"text":"Я весьма уверен в тебе.","en":"I have a lot of confidence in you.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Это хороший ресторан, но весьма дорогой.","en":"It's a good restaurant, but it's quite expensive.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"good, nice, fine"},{"g":"restaurant"},{"g":"but"},null,{"g":"dear, precious"}]},{"text":"Я вам весьма обязан.","en":"I'm much obliged to you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},null,null]},{"text":"Я был весьма удивлён.","en":"I was quite surprised.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null]}]}